vity","qidongqi","rust","search","tauri","utility","utools","wox"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个可以容忍错别字的 Windows 应用程序启动器！","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/ghost-him/ZeroLaunch-rs/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.txt","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"打错字照样秒开应用！ZeroLaunch 是一款纯粹专注的 Windows 应用程序启动器，拥有智能纠错能力和毫秒级的极速响应。它基于 Rust、Tauri 和 Vue.js 构建，旨在提供极致的性能和纯粹的体验。主要特性包括：高效智能搜索，得益于独创的算法，程序在全称/拼音/首字母三重匹配的基础上具备卓越的拼写纠错能力，并支持中英文混合查询；隐私至上，软件完全离线运行，零数据采集，您的所有数据和设置都严格保留在本地设备中；轻巧纯粹，专注于应用程序搜索与启动，无任何冗余复杂的功能，开箱即用；高度可定制，外观界面支持高度自定义，包括背景、颜色、字体、窗口大小等，并支持微调搜索算法以满足个性化需求。核心功能还包括：快速搜索并启动普通应用及 UWP 应用，智能唤醒已打开的程序窗口，支持自定义添加程序、文件、网页搜索和系统命令，智能加载程序和 Steam 游戏图标，以及防止游戏时误触的游戏模式。","moniker":"zerolaunch","name":"ZeroLaunch-rs","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ghost-him/ZeroLaunch-rs","publisher":"ghost-him","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ghost-him","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/ghost-him/ZeroLaunch-rs/releases/tag/v0.6.2","tags":["launchy","listary","powertoys","rust","tauri","utools","wox","启动器","工具","快速","拼音","搜索","模糊搜索","生产力"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ghost-him","releaseDate":"2025-12-14","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/ghost-him/ZeroLaunch-rs/releases/tag/v0.6.2","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/g/ghost-him/ZeroLaunch-rs/0.6.2/ghost-him.ZeroLaunch-rs.yaml","sha256":"2f7c2d31d6c9ee165b42dd73cc1c5025c8064097af78a758e65bb0e73723a5f4"},{"path":"manifests/g/ghost-him/ZeroLaunch-rs/0.6.2/ghost-him.ZeroLaunch-rs.installer.yaml","sha256":"ffed64b468e4fa406f132a44af8fd2b05a28d98a9024c965333f2d2c168e63fc"},{"path":"manifests/g/ghost-him/ZeroLaunch-rs/0.6.2/ghost-him.ZeroLaunch-rs.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"6a20790e2de39038d98599c8007b4d826d1e7bb31bd774a4c2d245947e07cbe5"},{"path":"manifests/g/ghost-him/ZeroLaunch-rs/0.6.2/ghost-him.ZeroLaunch-rs.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"0ce163b45a0460a5ed683c83851d93ed0f75dd2db4c25